{
  "id": 19,
  "name": "LocalDistanceLookahead",
  "intent": "This heuristic enhances the nearest neighbor approach by adding a one-step lookahead. It penalizes candidates that are isolated (i.e., have a large distance to their nearest unvisited neighbor), which is intended to reduce the occurrence of long edges later in the tour. The goal is to produce a more compact initial tour that can be effectively refined by the limited 2-opt budget.",
